                                "sense_id": "7b788117-5afe-3501-a239-40f680915e51",
                                "text": "De groene meerkat of vervet monkey (Cercopithecus aethiops) is de meest voorkomende aap in zuidelijk Afrika.",
                                "translation": "The African green monkey or vervet monkey (Cercopithecus aethiops) is the most common monkey in southern Africa.",
                                "english": "The African green monkey or vervet monkey (Cercopithecus aethiops) is the most common monkey in southern Africa."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6820885b-871c-4099-8787-2ce952a80831",
                                "sense_id": "7b788117-5afe-3501-a239-40f680915e51",
                                "text": "2016, Sterre Leufkens, Taal, in Elementaire deeltjes, vol. 40, Amsterdam University Press (publ.), page 32.\nHet bijzondere aan meerkatten is dat ze hun waarschuwingssignalen betekenisvol kunnen combineren met andere woordjes.",
                                "translation": "The special thing about guenons is that they can meaningfully combine their warning signals with other short words.",
